Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.05,0:00:05.15,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,{\i1}When we get older, let's sing PriPara together-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:14.05,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}My birthdate is June 6th.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.05,0:00:16.63,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Mine is June 6th, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.63,0:00:21.97,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Devidevi! Throw wide the gates of darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.97,0:00:23.36,Default-Alt,Aloma,0,0,0,,Devi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:27.23,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma did a great job playing the role of a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.31,0:00:32.07,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,{\i1} Huh? Become demon and angel idols?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.39,0:00:33.67,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.67,0:00:36.69,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}One day we shall rule over PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.69,0:00:38.13,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.13,0:00:42.63,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,{\i1}If that's what you want, we shall play demon and angel together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.09,0:00:47.86,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,That's why that picture's so precious to us-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:50.19,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,We'll treasure it forever-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.95,0:02:27.02,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Keep it a Secret From Aloma-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:31.73,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I'm against it-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.73,0:02:35.96,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,If we form a team with Aloma and Mikan it won't end well-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.96,0:02:37.06,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.06,0:02:40.14,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It would really complicate things-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.14,0:02:41.78,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Did something happen-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.78,0:02:43.63,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Something like Aloma talking down to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.63,0:02:45.07,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.40,0:02:45.06,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,I take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:47.30,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.30,0:02:52.44,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I see. So thou wouldst like to team up with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:55.33,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Thou hast finally given into my magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.33,0:02:58.30,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,It seems that would make thee PriPara's rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.30,0:03:01.80,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Hence all thou should be saying is\N"A pop and a step and a squeak squeak".
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:04.89,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,That'd be terrible-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.89,0:03:06.64,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,There's no way I could handle it-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:10.52,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But you did praise Aloma-chan that one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:11.64,Default,Mrelle,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.64,0:03:14.91,Default,Mrelle,0,0,0,,Well, she does have her good points-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.91,0:03:18.28,Default,Mrelle,0,0,0,,I used to say that it's weird for an angel and demon to get along,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:20.40,Default,Mrelle,0,0,0,,but in reality they get along really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.53,0:03:25.24,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem like they get into arguments, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.36,0:03:28.35,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Those two arguing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.35,0:03:30.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.33,0:03:33.96,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Well, Mirelle, you should really think it over-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:36.68,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,And while you do that, we'll go find out what they think-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.68,0:03:39.06,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Let's go talk to them-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.06,0:03:40.34,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:41.21,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:43.21,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.42,0:03:46.34,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.34,0:03:47.92,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:51.22,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,My all hearing ears are issuing a warning-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.51,0:03:54.56,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I've caught an emergency signal-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.56,0:03:55.72,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.72,0:03:59.23,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,SoLaMi Smile is on their way to talk to Alomagedon-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:00.85,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Wha'd you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.85,0:04:03.48,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,So they had the same idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.48,0:04:05.44,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Let's do it before them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.71,0:04:07.66,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorthy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:08.96,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's strike while the iron's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:10.62,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.23,0:04:22.43,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,"The once-sealed door to the palace shall soon be opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.43,0:04:27.09,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The angel and demon who hold the key shall divide heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.09,0:04:32.56,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Dream Alomagedon shall release a great surprise upon PriPara."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.97,0:04:37.10,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,What dost thou think, Mikan? Mysterious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.84,0:04:38.52,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.60,0:04:43.87,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.87,0:04:48.65,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Mikan said she had things to take care of today so I should head home without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:04.27,Default-Alt,Rand1,0,0,0,,What about Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.27,0:05:05.82,Default-Alt,Rand2,0,0,0,,Oh, you were invited too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:08.12,Default-Alt,Rand1,0,0,0,,Yeah, then we should invite Azusa, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.12,0:05:09.37,Default-Alt,Rand2,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.05,0:05:12.68,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:14.18,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Mikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:17.35,Default-Alt,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.67,0:05:17.35,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,What happened, Mikan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.35,0:05:19.76,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Thou said thou had things to take care of\N and to head home without thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.76,0:05:21.36,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Ah, Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:23.98,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan is hungry and her stomach's all grumbly-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:26.94,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,She used all her energy during gym today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:29.95,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,But what about the things thou had to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.95,0:05:31.36,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.36,0:05:31.91,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.37,0:05:35.43,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,A sandwich-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.99,0:05:37.83,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Hey! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:39.79,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Guess I'll have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.21,0:05:44.10,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I shall procure the corpse of a swine wrapped in white skin for thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.10,0:05:46.77,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Thanks for getting a pork bun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.77,0:05:49.02,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Wait there, I'll be back momentarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.02,0:05:51.79,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,May you have heaven's blessing, Aloma-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.79,0:05:53.76,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I need not that blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.40,0:05:59.68,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:03.34,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Mikan, you're late-nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:05.51,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Tomorrow is Aloma's birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.51,0:06:08.72,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Come on, we need to get started on the party planning-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:10.90,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I'll delay it another thirty minutes-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.90,0:06:13.55,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan's starving and can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.55,0:06:16.12,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Don't you want to make Aloma happy-nekon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.37,0:06:16.95,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.95,0:06:18.91,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan will do her best!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.91,0:06:21.62,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,But most importantly, you want to make it a surprise, right-nekon?{kind of swapped words here and the next line to make better flow}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:23.42,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,So keep it a secret from Aloma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.42,0:06:24.96,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,G-Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.96,0:06:26.88,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan won't say anything to Aloma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.14,0:06:30.10,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Anything at all-nano...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.28,0:06:34.61,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Five pork buns please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.61,0:06:35.85,Default,Lady,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.76,0:06:39.23,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Crap! I only have seven yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.23,0:06:41.96,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,This isn't even enough to take a ferry across the River Styx.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:43.77,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,What should I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.54,0:06:45.78,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I've found the demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:46.73,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.17,0:06:49.19,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,We'd like to talk with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.66,0:06:51.83,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,We were just looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:55.40,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,The Summer GranPri will be starting in a few weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.40,0:07:00.66,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,With that, how about forming a five person Dream Team with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.66,0:07:03.91,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I-I see.  So ye have finally come around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.91,0:07:05.40,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Yes, yes! Let us do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:07.38,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,But first, Mikan is in grave danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:08.27,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.27,0:07:11.75,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,If I don't get her foodstuff soon, she'll become a shrivelled angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.75,0:07:12.84,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Shrivelled?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.22,0:07:16.18,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I see. So that will happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.49,0:07:20.04,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Then you should come to our okonomiyaki restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:22.14,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,After all, it's nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.35,0:07:27.31,Default,Nako,0,0,0,,So? Has this sated your appetite a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.98,0:07:32.78,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,A little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.78,0:07:35.03,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Then we should get started-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.61,0:07:37.28,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:37.99,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.39,0:07:39.90,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We finally found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:41.20,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,We've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:45.41,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mega-neesan told us you went to Overlook Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:49.74,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We came to ask you about forming a Dream Team with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.74,0:07:53.24,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sophie will perform a dance to convey our true feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:56.38,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I want to try being a jellyfish angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.73,0:07:58.32,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.32,0:08:00.20,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,So you've finally decided-nano?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:02.10,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I'm in full support-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:05.81,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I'm sure Aloma wouldn't object either-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:07.44,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:10.18,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Now all we need to do is get Mirelle's approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:10.77,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.77,0:08:12.10,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.10,0:08:14.66,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Since we're going to form a Dream Team...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.45,0:08:16.54,Default,Sola,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.54,0:08:18.70,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Tomorrow is Aloma-chan's birthday?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.35,0:08:22.44,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,She was born at exactly 6 o'clock on June 6th.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:24.17,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,6 6 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.17,0:08:26.66,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,She truly is the poster child of the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:29.42,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,We want to throw her a huge party-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:31.41,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,We have a lot of decorations and other things to put up,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.41,0:08:34.88,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,and since we're forming a Dream Team,\N why don't you help us out-nekon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.52,0:08:36.63,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.84,0:08:40.76,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Red ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:42.47,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Blue ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.83,0:08:45.18,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,And I'm Ushioni, the cow ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.18,0:08:47.65,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,So what do you think of our demon costumes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:49.03,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Wrong genre.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.03,0:08:50.14,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.14,0:08:52.67,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I'll explain it some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.67,0:08:53.90,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,So where's the foodstuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.53,0:08:56.85,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Here's our Pig & Rice special.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.85,0:08:59.61,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It's the closest thing we have to a pork bun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.03,0:09:01.26,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'll make one for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.26,0:09:02.75,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:05.28,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Mikan has only eaten that which I have given her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:06.32,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.32,0:09:07.58,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,You sure are good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:11.30,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,You're not mixing it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.30,0:09:14.75,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Could this be the first time you've made okonomiyaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:16.14,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Devi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:17.79,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Don't take a demon lightly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:22.47,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,For someone 660,011 years old such as myself,\Nnothing in this world is unbeknownst to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.94,0:09:25.34,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Let's start with the cake-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:26.70,Default,Sola,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.70,0:09:31.68,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Whisk together the milk and eggs to make the sponge-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:34.86,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Over here you'll be making the decorations to top it with-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:36.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,E-Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.33,0:09:37.57,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,These are the toppings?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.87,0:09:40.01,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Aloma is a demon-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.01,0:09:46.77,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Decorating the cake with things like chocolate centipedes, pillbug cookies, or bat wings will go over big with her-nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.92,0:09:51.87,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.87,0:09:53.20,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Yes. Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.20,0:09:55.02,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,How is this worth praising?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:56.17,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Praise me instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.59,0:10:00.38,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,The first one is done, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.04,0:10:03.50,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,...there's still something left to be desired-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.50,0:10:05.15,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Y-You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:07.39,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I think it has plenty of impact...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.39,0:10:08.76,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,No! Not quite!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.76,0:10:12.10,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,It needs to be more stylish for someone like Aloma, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.51,0:10:14.56,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just what does she have in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.85,0:10:41.30,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}I realise she isn't a bad kid, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.30,0:10:45.14,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder if things would turn out okay if we form a Dream Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.10,0:10:50.48,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}It'll be really hard to accept that cocky attitude day in and day out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.71,0:10:55.77,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to treasure each and every concert I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:10:58.27,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}If she doesn't share those feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.27,0:11:00.32,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}forming a team would be pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.83,0:11:12.55,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just what is she thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.85,0:11:16.78,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did she really write all these?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.78,0:11:17.71,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.71,0:11:22.85,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wow! She wrote this much?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:28.80,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}So it's six notebooks enclosed in one binder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.64,0:11:34.08,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}She put a lot of effort into building her demon character every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.08,0:11:37.92,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}And it's precisely because she did this year in year out...{And it's precisely because of doing that\Nyear after year that once she made her debut,}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:41.73,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}...that she could make it all the way to\NPromising Rookie shortly after her début.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:45.95,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your character image with all pri this and pri that is the most shallow of all!{consistency ep 41}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.32,0:11:49.92,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course I understand why she said that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:53.11,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if she thinks it's a shallow character,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:55.66,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}why does it seem like she wants to form a Dream Team with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.97,0:11:59.92,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amazing. These aren't just prophecies,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.92,0:12:02.56,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}they are pinups for PriPara concerts as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:04.88,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's one for SoLaMi Smile, Dressing Parfait...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.33,0:12:08.59,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}This one's from my solo concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.59,0:12:11.63,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mirelle doesn't have the smarts to say anything other than pri this and pri that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.63,0:12:15.10,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to change her "pri" to "bri" with one of my curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.55,0:12:18.52,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it was still a wonderful concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.20,0:12:23.98,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mirelle is the best pop idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.98,0:12:29.62,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's because she can make her viewer's hearts pop and dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:32.95,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}She even got my blood pumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.91,0:12:38.17,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.13,0:12:42.31,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mirelle is the hardest working idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.31,0:12:44.07,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}She doesn't miss a day of practice.{I almost want to liberal this and go with "She doesn't miss a beat" cause of the forced music pun, but I won't}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:46.17,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't forget the effort she puts into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.40,0:12:50.66,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.66,0:12:52.56,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.56,0:12:55.08,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You should be more honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.83,0:13:00.10,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mirelle, have you made up your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:02.62,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:05.55,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Let's form a five person team with Alomagedon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:07.26,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,They're no different than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.26,0:13:09.72,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I finally understand that we'll all work hard when we're together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.72,0:13:10.43,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.43,0:13:12.83,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That's the Mirelle I know! I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:15.60,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,All right, that side's done, Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:16.54,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Now flip it over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:24.96,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,So, are you sure this isn't your first go at grilling okonomiyaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:27.48,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,T'was only a slip of the hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.48,0:13:31.22,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,There's nothing a 660,011 year old demon cannot do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.22,0:13:31.93,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Next one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.93,0:13:35.88,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I see. It's for her birthday-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:38.39,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,If that's the case, I'll be glad to help-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.87,0:13:43.03,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Now that Mirelle's helping{joining}, there's nothing to worry about.{suddenly I'm reassured}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.03,0:13:43.86,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.03,0:13:43.86,Default-Alt,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.33,0:13:46.51,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,First you add the eggs-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.51,0:13:47.57,Default-Alt,Sophie,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.51,0:13:47.57,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.57,0:13:48.55,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.55,0:13:50.78,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But we had a ton{so many} of eggs just a moment ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:53.93,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mikan never gets tired of eggs over rice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.93,0:13:56.30,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Really, Mikan?!{hey you/come on/hold on}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.30,0:14:00.21,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Next we'll put the biscuits in a plastic bag and smash them into pieces-pri.{break them into small bits-pri.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:03.67,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Huh? I just warmed the biscuits up a moment ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:07.00,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.91,0:14:11.59,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Wait! We still need to use that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.89,0:14:14.60,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Stop that-nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.85,0:14:19.28,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Why are you capisce with eating everything?!{Not sure how you want to deal with kashikomaru. }
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.28,0:14:21.19,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,It was a mistake-nano! A mistake-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:23.61,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Must endure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.61,0:14:27.19,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}This is the special cake for Aloma-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:34.16,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}This is the special cake for Aloma-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.16,0:14:38.29,Default-Alt,Mikan,0,0,0,,*stare*
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.69,0:14:36.39,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Let's remake it-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.39,0:14:37.14,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.14,0:14:38.29,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.12,0:14:42.69,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.69,0:14:43.58,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:48.38,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It's a Red Flash rice ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.38,0:14:51.16,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Thank you-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:54.72,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan will be able to hold out with this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:56.57,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.30,0:14:59.39,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Faster. Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.13,0:15:02.60,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Mikan is waiting there starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.08,0:15:06.15,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Mikan only eats what I give her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.99,0:15:10.54,Default,All,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:14.82,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,{blueish red}A cake with purple food colouring is Aloma's favourite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.79,0:15:18.64,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,She did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.64,0:15:22.32,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Since we ate all the ones you messed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:24.04,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,there's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:26.35,Default,Mikala,0,0,0,,Hooray! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.35,0:15:29.08,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,All that's left is to add the strawberries and it'll be complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.08,0:15:30.11,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.11,0:15:32.54,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Well done, ladies-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.54,0:15:35.01,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,With this, we're ready for tomorrow's party-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:39.71,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Sophie-chan, Lala-chan, Mirelle-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.71,0:15:41.12,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Thank you-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.12,0:15:45.48,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan will be able to give Aloma the best\Nbirthday present ever thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:48.89,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I-It's not like I did it for Aloma-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.89,0:15:51.39,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,You sounded just like Aloma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.39,0:15:51.98,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.84,0:15:54.16,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah, just like her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.16,0:15:54.74,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.74,0:15:56.86,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Wai{\fscx300}-{\fscx100}  Man...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.63,0:16:00.24,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Our charms rang-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:01.20,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.53,0:16:03.82,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,But they're not that bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.82,0:16:05.08,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.08,0:16:09.26,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Going off in unison is a sign of a Dream Team-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:10.66,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,You're almost there-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:15.30,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Anyway, isn't it about time for your concert, SoLaMi Smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.30,0:16:17.42,Default-Alt,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Ah, you're right-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.30,0:16:17.42,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ah, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.42,0:16:19.50,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You're pretty {knowledgable}reliable, Neko-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:24.77,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,As an Excellent Manager,\NI've memorized the day's schedule-nekon.{To be an excellent manager, you need to memorize the day's schedule-nekon.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.77,0:16:30.23,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Now then, show me a concert full of your Dream Team aspirations-nekon.{Now then, show me a concert full of aspirations of forming a Dream Team-nekon.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.23,0:16:31.37,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.82,0:16:36.59,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.82,0:16:40.24,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.16,0:16:43.92,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.97,0:16:56.18,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,{The three members of SoLaMi Smile are entering with the}SoLaMi Smile will be performing in their Dream Heart Race Coord that's popular amongst all the girls in PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.11,0:17:01.55,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Show off your cute bellybutton,\Ngo out there and put on a super peppy concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.55,0:17:04.26,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Dream Heart Race Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.04,0:18:00.75,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I hope that Mikan-chan's feelings...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.75,0:18:01.87,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,...and the cake...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.87,0:18:03.62,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,...reach Aloma-pri!{yeah, there's no way to break this line up in the proper word order}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:08.91,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:13.44,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.44,0:18:15.42,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.42,0:18:17.42,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Leave it to me-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.41,0:18:21.79,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Let's start it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.79,0:18:24.53,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,The Good Friends Sweets Party!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:29.31,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.62,0:19:15.40,Default,Fan1,0,0,0,,SoLaMi Smile is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:18.99,Default,Fan2,0,0,0,,Do your best at your Dream Theatre concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.94,0:19:25.82,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Sorry I took so long, Mikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.82,0:19:28.25,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.25,0:19:29.80,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.80,0:19:31.01,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.01,0:19:32.29,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,She's not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.69,0:19:34.23,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Mikan...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.23,0:19:36.39,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Was she carried off by wild dogs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.39,0:19:37.71,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.68,0:19:47.72,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Aloma?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.72,0:19:49.38,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,You can take a short...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.38,0:19:50.39,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,...break.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.45,0:20:02.30,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We finished our concert-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.30,0:20:03.44,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Is the cake done?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.44,0:20:04.65,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.63,0:20:11.52,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Waah! Mikan ate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:13.37,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Ate it-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.37,0:20:14.83,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Crap-nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.83,0:20:17.44,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,She couldn't stop herself from eating it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.44,0:20:19.29,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma's cake is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.07,0:20:25.47,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.47,0:20:28.21,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Sorry-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.21,0:20:30.06,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Want to make another?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.06,0:20:31.68,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Okay! Let's make another!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.47,0:20:34.84,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But this time, we'll all eat it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.84,0:20:35.89,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.31,0:20:40.11,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I suppose you {\i1}do{\i0} need to taste test it-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.39,0:20:43.52,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Delicious, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.52,0:20:45.15,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan wants to eat more!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.15,0:20:47.03,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You sure do eat a lot-pri.{you really are a glutton}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.11,0:20:55.49,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:56.96,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Mikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:20:57.99,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,You're here with SoLaMi Smile{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.99,0:20:58.96,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Don't-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:00.92,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,This is a secret-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.92,0:21:02.50,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Don't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.50,0:21:03.68,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.68,0:21:07.13,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Besides, thou are accepting food from someone other than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.13,0:21:09.12,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,M-Mikan is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.12,0:21:10.90,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Hold on, Aloma.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.90,0:21:14.85,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,When Mikan is hungry, she'll accept food from anyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.90,0:21:20.06,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Alomagedon is no more!{disbanded}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.40,0:21:24.16,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Angels and demons divide heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.16,0:21:27.78,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,You shall be cursed for all eternity!{There will not be a moment you are not cursed.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.78,0:21:29.74,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Derodero derosaimu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.74,0:21:30.95,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.15,0:23:07.58,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Aloma-chan, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.58,0:23:09.59,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mikan-chan was doing it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.59,0:23:10.88,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.88,0:23:12.88,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth have been divided!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:16.85,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,PriPara shall now play host to the final battle between angels and demons!{This is the moment PriPara shall enter into the final battle between angels and demons!}{From here, PriPara shall enter into the final battle between angels and demons!}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.85,0:23:18.30,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Final battle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.30,0:23:20.77,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,It's Mikan's fault Aloma is upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.77,0:23:24.02,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan will try making a heartfelt present once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.02,0:23:25.19,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.19,0:23:26.88,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We'll cheer you on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.88,0:23:29.14,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,No way! It's not happening! You can't make me!{It's absolutely, completely, and hopelessly futile!}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.14,0:23:29.80,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.80,0:23:32.02,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,June 6th, Idol Breakup!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.02,0:23:33.34,Default,All,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.34,0:23:34.86,Default,All,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
